Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sankyu!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(183.2,35.2)\fs14}Sankyu is the phonetic adaptation in katakana of the English expression 'thank you'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just watching the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinjuku, Kabukicho?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, isn't that right around the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They said someone died...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like details are still unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.56,0:00:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading straight back after one look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, in Kabukicho, Shinjuku,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,five men and women fell from a building
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,in a severe accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bodies were heavily damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and the police department is rushing \Nto confirm their identities,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,while investigating the possibility of a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukumoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What about school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't bring myself to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,let me treat you to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, I still get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SHOW...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,YOURSELF!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,STOP IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,DIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:03:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get anywhere \Nnear Jashin anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We were saved because you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you go through such pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukumoya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't push yourself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can help,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can see that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that church is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A Crystal Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you...? \NDon't worry, I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just called out to you \Nbecause I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kouzaki Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Win Kirifuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Winnn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kouzaki Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, isn't he from our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's been coming at all lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why he knows about me-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,150.4)\frz17.48\org(162.4,137.6)}Miyai
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next weekend,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Duel Colosseum is finally taking place!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tournament where only the top duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,nationwide get invited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The organizer is a street duel legend \Nnamed Murasaki-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and believe it or not, I was invited too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I have a request...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you and Niika come support me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win this tournament...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.31,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to confess to Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Miyai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a huge death flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the favor of a lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Win, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Miyai say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:06:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to drop in suddenly, Murasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Win Kirifuda is going to \Nnext week's Duel Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with a game perfect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think will happen \Nif you fight Win Kirifuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take all the Crystal Cards \Nyou've collected, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if I beat him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my Crystal Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,my life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's luckier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Colosseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-night death game featuring top duelists!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The total prize money is an astounding...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,1 Billion Yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the winner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,a special match against Murasaki awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,are you ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What intense enthusiasm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this staging also meant to test \Nour fighting spirit and resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Murasaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've prepared mountain loads of bait \Njust for you today, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Win...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Miyai at the venue already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry over...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Win,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but you don't have to push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai will be fine on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I win with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives me chills, Murasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What insane excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My match is starting soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,150.4)\frz17.48\org(162.4,137.6)\fs14}Miyai
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Miyai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you here, Win?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nearby, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whoa!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika, stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was invited to the Duema tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you too, Win-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend is participating in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't reach him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Something bad might have happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able might have happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,WAAAAAAAAIT!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did you suddenly \Nstart running off by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone would be worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been so down lately, and besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check around the venue perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll go check inside the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is Kazuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What the hell is going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He just lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we enter the Special Match!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting your life on the line to battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the best, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Undefeated in 500 matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruler of Street Duels!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Key's Legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,MURASAKI!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear gripping your entire body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,excitement and despair taking turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those who overcome that glance \Nget showered with blissful euphoria!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go together...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To the other side of ecstasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us out! \NI don't wanna die! I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,shall we enjoy the main dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And here comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a new challenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Win Kirifuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's uncool, Win Kirifuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna abandon your friend and run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Miyai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the ultimate stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Crystal Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You better put your life on the line too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you gonna do, Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy... \Nis he overwhelming Jashin...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana charge Jashin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he fighting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he scared of Jashin...? \NWin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight on the edge...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The real deal starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Another gamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you stopped it, \Ndo you even have any moves left?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, \Nyou can't rely on Jashin-sama anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Win Kirifuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in this situation, you're trying to land \Na direct final blow on me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Too naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You really give me chills...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Win Kirifuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're okay over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost rescued us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai is safe too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the noise is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's just the two of us, \Nlet's enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,14.933)\c&H00D7FF&\3c&H00008B&\4c&H000000&}Tojjo Apolo Hitsubako
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs7\pos(320.533,36.267)}When this creature enters \Nthe battlefield, choose from the following \N3 times. (You may choose the same \Noption multiple times.)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs7\pos(320,63.289)}[1] Draw 2 cards, then have your opponent \Nchoose 1 card from your hand without looking, \Nand discard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs7\pos(324.267,103.111)}[2] Choose 1 of your creatures. This turn, \Nthat creature gets +2000 power. \NThen, you may choose 1 of \Nyour opponent's creatures. \NThose 2 creatures battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs7\pos(320,124.444)}[3] Choose 1 of your opponent's non-creature \Nelements and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00D7FF&\3c&H00008B&\4c&H000000&\fs9\pos(62.4,57.6)}Name: Tojjo Apolo Hitsubako   \NCard Type: Creature   \NRace: Hinogami / Lost Crusader   \NCost / Power: Cost 10 / Power 5000
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,3-consecutive gamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Murasaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First pull, come on! \NTake it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha! I'm gonna kill you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and kill your friends along with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's another landslide victory for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,luckier than me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The match is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.53,0:19:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.53,0:19:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,really Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw with me, \NWin Kirifuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought \Nyou were a good gambler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the Crystal Cards...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You really gave me a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're finally in the mood \Nto use my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't let you have your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.63,0:22:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, we will be departing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't made my confession yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Manito!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{pos(194.133,34.844)\fs12\pos(187.733,27.022)}Manito = abbreviation \Nfrom hermanito(little brother) in Spanish
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.39,0:22:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really Win, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.57,0:22:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so terribly worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on...?
